    "tree_id": "a5b46154385701c13118e564e1be164b4d95f896",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:732] build(delivery): private IPA 732 = the delivered 731 with XeniaCore c7d6a5c4, S2Arm engine 9560e56f and the licence audit\n\nSecond request. Frozen on 474862f5 (effective digest 662f421f, 7956 product files). Base: the\ndelivered and verified 731 (run 43238363574).\n- XeniaCore pin c7d6a5c4 (2bbc9daf7, run 43241572889), per session 03:\n  - player 1 signed in to a profile before the title runs: the cause of\n    Fable Anniversary's START refused on 730; stable console identity for\n    saves;\n  - guest message boxes and keyboard shown on the render window;\n  - rumble; all pads merged; the menu opens when the last pad is lost.\n- Licence audit (c1dddbdaa), per session 03:\n  - RA disc-reader notices, date (MIT) notices for XeniOS;\n  - RewindBox-MODIFICATIONS.md required;\n  - legal dialog assets and entries; package LICENSE files;\n  - legal test chain repaired.\n  The disc reader review accepts the delivered tree's previously declared\n  libretro podspec (main, 8d7928ec).\n- S2Arm engine pin 9560e56f (496e1d8f), per session 04:\n  - patch 0011: the store emulation self-test is skipped under the JIT\n    helper. It stalled Mario Kart World's boot 10 minutes on 731;\n  - the spare pool also covers the boot code;\n  - the engine log is copied to Files.\n- First request, run 43283225614: the flutter job failed on two S2Arm tests\n  that predate the licence audit (helper LICENSE copy record, engine review\n  no longer the last pubspec review). Fixed in 67645447; all 43 Python tests\n  of the group pass locally.\n- RPCS3 Core 934 and MeloNX Core 743 kept.\nNothing of this build was run on an iPhone; no FPS, memory, heat or\nstability claim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-12T19:20:19Z",
